 "about": "The standard equipment of this robot, given to every new application made on it: the basic grippers and the tool rack they stand in. A new application gets a COPY of these (viewer/appfiles.py, new_application) and is free to change or remove them; to change what new applications start with, change this folder. Poses are in the table frame of this robot. The rack stands in a column along the east edge of the breadboard, beside the robot, so that the working area in front of it stays free: stand centres at x 1.1375 m (the tools reach to 15 mm from the edge), 62.5 mm apart, all within 0.45 m of the robot's base.",
